<title>BRAZIL: Details of coffees included in Brazil govt auction.</title>
<headline>Details of coffees included in Brazil govt auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of the 256,990 60-kg bags of coffee stocks to be auctioned by the Brazilian government at 1400 local/1700 GMT on March 5 are as follows.</p>
<p>Some 174,380 bags will be on offer to the whole coffee sector but 82,610 bags will only be available to the domestic soluble industry because of the number of defects, the sales document said.</p>
<p>Quantity is given in bags.</p>
<p>   QTY	CROP     COLOR	LOCATION		   TYPE</p>
<p> 59,233  1987/88   Yellowish   Araraquara, SP		6</p>
<p>  4,024  1988/89   Yellowish   Alphaville/Berueri, SP    6</p>
<p> 13,600  1987/88   Yellowish   Loanda, PR		  6/7</p>
<p>  2,500  1981/82   Yellowish   Pioneiros/Londrina, PR    6</p>
<p>  1,300   1986/87  Greenish    Pioneiros/Londrina, PR    6</p>
<p> 20,750   1987/88  Yellowish   Maringa, PR		   6</p>
<p> 32,950   1987/88  Greenish    Ribeirao do Pinhal, PR    6</p>
<p>  4,663   1982/83  Yellowish   Carangola, MG		 6</p>
<p>  6,537   1986/87  Yellowish   Carangola, MG		 6</p>
<p> 13,823   1987/88  Yellowish   Juiz de Fora, MG	    6</p>
<p> 15,000   1986/87  Yellowish   Campos Altos, MG	  5/6</p>
<p>TOTAL - 174,380 bags</p>
<p>The following 82,610 bags are only for the soluble coffee industry as they are all below type 8. Number of defects are given.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION	  DEFECTS</p>
<p>    7,500   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 400</p>
<p>   13,900   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 420</p>
<p>    8,200   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 480</p>
<p>    9,300   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 660</p>
<p>   11,100   1983/84   Greenish    Nova Esperanca, PR	 660</p>
<p>    7,200   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 600</p>
<p>    7,900   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, PR	 660</p>
<p>    7,144   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		380</p>
<p>    4,600   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, PR		390</p>
<p>    5,766   1983/84   Yellowish   Pioneiros/Londrina, PR   400</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
